# m6_cores: CORE HOURS pays once. m6_pickup's input to 1849 (the sweep in probe mode and its
# long hold at 903..982 that leaves the bar at 20) plus a hold-B at 1747..1756 just after the
# core hours crate is collected. Fuel is meta state (not in the World), so the grant is paid
# by main.zig against a high-water mark on the World counter debug_cores. (Re-pinned for M7:
# the crate is collected at 1740 instead of 1383; see m6_pickup.)
# - 1740 (game tick 1469): crate collected, cores 0 -> 1, fuel 101 -> 161 (+60), score 1004.
# - B 1747..1756 (10 frames = 20 ticks, 2 fuel each): 1749 is back at tick 1469, still
#   collected; 1750 (tick 1467) is before the grab: cores 0, score 904, the crate back on
#   screen. The fuel is NOT given back by the rewind: 154 (162 minus the hold's 8). 1756:
#   tick 1455, fuel 142. 1757: the release (PLAYING, no tick).
# - 1766 (tick 1464): the ship grabs the same crate again: cores 1, score 1004 (the +100 is
#   World state and comes back), but the fuel stays 143 (the refill alone): cores never rises
#   above its high-water mark of 1, so nothing more is paid.
--frames 1850 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_cores,debug_fuel,debug_score --at "1739 debug_fuel == 101" --at "1740 debug_cores == 1" --at "1740 debug_fuel == 161" --at "1749 debug_cores == 1" --at "1750 debug_state == 5" --at "1750 debug_cores == 0" --at "1750 debug_score == 904" --at "1750 debug_pickups == 1" --at "1750 debug_fuel == 154" --at "1750 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1756 debug_game_tick == 1455" --at "1756 debug_fuel == 142" --at "1757 debug_state == 1" --at "1765 debug_cores == 0" --at "1766 debug_cores == 1" --at "1766 debug_score == 1004" --at "1766 debug_fuel == 143" --at "1770 debug_fuel == 143" --at "1800 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_cores == 1"
